@startuml
!theme plain
!pragma layout smetana
title TASK-260715-111tde — Relay protocol source and runtime ownership

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

artifact ".spec relay/security docs\nADR-005 / ADR-006" as Specs
artifact "Protocol/Relay/relay-v1.schema.json\nhandwritten wire authority" as Schema
component "scripts/relay-protocol-tool.py\nbuild-only deterministic generator" as Generator
artifact "Protocol/Relay/Vectors/v1\nindependently audited vectors" as Vectors

package "SwiftPM: ReluxTunnelCore" #EAF3FF {
  component "RelayProtocolV1+Generated.swift\nvalues + layout metadata" as SwiftGenerated
  component "RelayProtocol handwritten Swift\nhello, codecs, session semantics" as SwiftProtocol
  component "SSHRelaySessionPump\nbounded SSHExecChannel binding" as SwiftPump
}

package "Go module: relay/" #EFFFF0 {
  component "internal/protocol/generated_v1.go\nvalues + layout metadata" as GoGenerated
  component "internal/protocol handwritten Go\nhello, codecs, session semantics" as GoProtocol
  component "internal/stdio\none reader + one stdout writer" as Stdio
  component "internal/udp\nbounded associations + sockets" as UDP
}

component "TASK-260720-100wu6\nSSHExecChannel" as SSH
component "Apple packet-tunnel runtime\nHEV datagram adapter" as Apple
component "relux-relay ~--stdio ~--protocol 1\nrootless process" as Relay
component "TASK-260715-18owh7\nexact limit contract" as Limits #FFF4CC

Specs --> Schema : reviewed v1 semantics
Schema --> Generator : canonical JSON input
Generator --> SwiftGenerated : checked-in output
Generator --> GoGenerated : checked-in output
SwiftGenerated --> SwiftProtocol
GoGenerated --> GoProtocol
Vectors ..> SwiftProtocol : same semantic corpus
Vectors ..> GoProtocol : same semantic corpus
Limits ..> SwiftProtocol : injected hard/effective limits
Limits ..> GoProtocol : injected hard/effective limits
SSH --> SwiftPump : bounded partial async I/O
SwiftProtocol --> SwiftPump
SwiftPump --> Apple
GoProtocol --> Stdio
Stdio --> Relay
Relay --> UDP : validated values only
Apple <--> Relay : identity preflight, then v1 frames\nover authenticated exec channels

note bottom of Generator
Generated code owns constants and metadata only.
Handwritten code owns behavior. No Swift/Go FFI.
end note

note bottom of UDP
Address, lengths, association, and datagram cap
must validate before resolution or socket use.
end note
@enduml
